		{
			"id": "AvcHYQg4u5GYGn4YJ",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 45, DX 10, IQ 13, HT 15, HP 45, WILL 15, PER 15, FP —, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 8, DODGE 10, DR 7. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "A3uDTenis8UQG9D1_",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 104 (offense 45, protection 59), threat tier severe, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "Awt7dsn6E1-eobHO8",
			"text": "Evil Gaze: When a creature locks eyes with the nightwalker, it must roll a Fright Check at a -3 penalty. If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by this ability for one hour."
		},
